# uvx demo: a first run with an empty uv cache. Re-record with: vhs docs/uvx.tape

Output docs/uvx.gif

Set Height 420
Source docs/style.tape

Hide
Type "export PATH=/opt/homebrew/bin:$PATH UV_CACHE_DIR=$(mktemp -d) PS1='\[\e[1;35m\]❯\[\e[0m\] '; clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 600ms
Type "uvx chargestat"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
